{"articleNo":"237471","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=237471&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [IT국비지원교육]SAP 혁신성장 청년인재 5기 교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.05.25","hit":"8122","attachments":[{"name":"2020 SAP 청년인재5기모집_브로셔 0518_최종본.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=237471&attachNo=88624"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-size: 11pt;\">2020</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">년 혁신성장 청년인재 집중양성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 4</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">기 모집이 높은 경쟁률로 마감되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">.         </span></span></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">성원에 감사 드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">더 많은 분들이 참여하실 수 있도록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 5</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">기에는 다양한 과정을 준비하였습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">.         </span></strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">        &nbsp;        </span></strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">과학기술정보통신부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">전담부처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">정보통신기획평가원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">전담기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">), SAP(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">주관기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">가 진행하는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">        </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">소프트웨어 개발자 양성 및 취업연계 등 다양한 혜택을 지원합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">​</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">▶ 교육기간</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> : 2020.06.16 ~ 2020.12.17 (6</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)        </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">▶ 모집과정</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> : </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">빅데이터 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> (48</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)        </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 70pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">스마트공장 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> (48</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)        </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 70pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">인공지능 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> (24</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)        </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">▶ 모집기간</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> : 2020</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 06</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 07</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">       </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">▶ 모집대상</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> : </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 34</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">세 이하 미취업자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> (20</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 6</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 7</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">일 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)        </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 50pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2021</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> 3</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월 이전 졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">       </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">▶ 교육장소</span></strong></spa